      hu: ["Gazdag történelmi háttérrel rendelkezik.", "Kulturálisan meghatározó jelentőségű a régióban.", "Egyedülálló turisztikai és kutatási célpont."],
      ro: ["Un element istoric cheie pentru Economic 14.", "O atracție culturală remarcabilă în zona Economic 14."],
      en: ["Exclusive export terminal for the Cerrejón coal mine.", "One of the few ports in the world capable of handling Capesize vessels.", "Connected to the mine by a private 150 km heavy-haul railway.", "Located in the protected Bahia de Portete in La Guajira.", "Utilizes a linear ship loader for high-speed, efficient cargo handling."]
