      en: ["First port in Colombia to implement a fully enclosed direct-loading system.", "Built to replace old barge-loading systems to protect the environment.", "Primary export point for major coal producers like Prodeco.", "Located in the strategic Ciénaga area of the Magdalena department.", "Features a 1.5-kilometer long offshore pier for deep-water access."]
