      en: ["Features a 237-meter high dam, once among the world's tallest.", "Has an installed capacity of 1,000 megawatts.", "Utilizes the waters of the Batá River in the department of Boyacá.", "A key contributor to the national interconnected power system since 1977.", "The reservoir is famous for its emerald-green waters."]
