      en: "Ingenio Providencia is a major agro-industrial complex located in the Valle del Cauca, dedicated to the large-scale production of sugar and its derivatives. It is recognized for its high standards of efficiency and its commitment to environmental sustainability through the 'Providencia Verde' initiative. The facility produces a wide range of sugars for domestic and international markets, as well as bioethanol for fuel blending. A significant portion of its energy needs is met through the cogeneration of electricity from biomass, contributing to a circular economy. The company also produces organic sugar, meeting the growing global demand for sustainable food products. Providencia plays a vital role in the socio-economic development of the region, supporting thousands of families through direct and indirect employment. Its modern infrastructure and focus on innovation make it a key player in the Colombian sugarcane sector."
