      en: "Mamonal is the most important industrial zone in Colombia, located on the southern shores of the Bay of Cartagena. This vast complex hosts over 60 large companies, primarily in the petrochemical, chemical, and energy sectors, including the Reficar refinery. Its strategic location next to the Port of Cartagena provides unparalleled access to international shipping lanes for the export of manufactured goods. The zone is characterized by a high degree of industrial synergy, where the products of one company often serve as raw materials for another. Mamonal is a major engine of the Colombian economy, contributing a significant percentage of the national industrial GDP. Over the years, the zone has made efforts to improve its environmental management and its relationship with the neighboring communities of Pasacaballo and Albornoz. It remains the premier destination for heavy industry and foreign investment in the Caribbean region."
